The '''HHMods QoL''' plugin (part of the [[HHMods]] suite) bundles quality-of-life improvements that polish existing game systems.

== Features ==

* '''Hunger / thirst polish''': color-coded HUD bars that shift color as the meter depletes, so critical states are noticeable at a glance.
* '''Empty-container tooltip''': shows "empty" on containers with no items so you don't waste time opening them (uses the game's existing <code>Loot_Mgr.No_Items_Inside</code> method).
* '''Filtered containers''': per-container tag filter state, backed by <code>Icon_Info._Tags</code>. Auto-sorts items into matching containers.
* '''Linked containers''': unifies inventory display across multiple <code>belongBIkey</code>s so grouped storage rooms appear as one virtual container.

== Technical ==

* '''Hunger / thirst''': Harmony postfix on <code>Char_Status.Update_Food_UI</code> and <code>Update_Water_UI</code>.
* '''Empty tooltip''': single-line postfix on <code>Loot_Mgr.No_Items_Inside(belongBIkey)</code>.
* '''Filtered / linked containers''': intercepts <code>Loot_Mgr.Enable_Loot_Window</code>; state persisted via <code>HHMods.Core.ModSidecar</code> keyed by <code>belongBIkey</code>.

